(
F5 W1 U6: linear_calculation_apply -yes: group_materi_plasti_hypo_wolffersdorff
 is deleted and substituted by group_materi_elasti_young with hs as Young's
 modulus and group_materi_elasti_poisson 0.2 (manual Professional 6.797).
 phi 0.5, hs 400: plane strain, x free, sigyy = -400/(1-0.2^2) x 0.01 =
 -4.1666667. The Professional 02-08-2026 takes the FIRST value (phi 0.5) as
 Young's modulus (sigyy -0.0052083); the GNU follows the manual
 (DIVERGENCES LINCALC-WOLFF, class D).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
materi_plasti_hypo_history
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 2 -ra -vely
bounda_dof 1 -ra 1 3 -ra -velx
bounda_dof 2 -ra 3 4 -ra -vely
bounda_time 2 0 0 1 -0.01
control_timestep 0 1 1
group_materi_plasti_hypo_wolffersdorff 0 0.5 400 0.3 0.9 0.6 1.1 0.1 1.
linear_calculation_apply -yes
target_item 0 -node_dof 4 -sigyy
target_value 0 -4.16666667 1.e-6
end_data
